      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This also affects display name changes on the nameplate (where pronouns are also displayed). When the user's display name is changed to something new via the website, the old display name will remain displayed on the nameplate in-client, but the new display name will be shown correctly immediately in join/leave notifications and when opening the user's profile in-app.\n\nIf the user rejoins the same instance, their nameplate will still be incorrectly displaying the old (cached) display name information, while the join notification will display their new display name.\n\nI assume the same issue is happening with pronouns edits here.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
