  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-02-03T13:01:04.605Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Open your vrchat profile either on the website or vrcx\n\n2. Edit your pronouns\n\nThe pronouns will not only take a while to show up locally, but will also be fairly random as to how long it takes to show up for other users in the same instance. This makes it irritating for some users to use as a way to signal pronoun-related information to other users.\n\nWhile I would not expect this to update instantly in all cases, nor would I expect it to be updated frequently in general, the fact that the update time varies so much seems wrong - the pipeline websocket gets the update immediately, but the client does not update its state, nor publish out that state change to other users in the instance like it would if edited in game.",
